---
layout: "@astrojs/starlight/components/MarkdownContent.astro"
highlighter: "@astrojs/starlight/components/Bedazzlr.astro"
title: 'agAST'
---
<!0:cstml>
<__>
  <p>
    "CSTML is an embedding for text documents, by which I mean that a CSTML document is a container that can hold and mark up any unicode text. agAST, then, is a container for CSTML documents. An agAST tree is capable of holding any CSTML document. In particular agAST encodes CSTML documents into a deeply immutable data structure made up of Javascript objects."
  </>
  
  <p>
    "Like CSTML, agAST documents are intended to be constructed and construed primarily using tools. JSON is neither a good way to construct agAST trees nor a good way to print them, which is one of the reasons CSTML came to exist in the first place."
  </>

  <p>
    "agAST actually offers two closely related ways of representing documents: as a stream of tags embedded in time, or as a tree of tags arranged in memory. Either way the document will basically be made up of tags, which makes tags a great place to start."
  </>

  <h2 "Tags" />

  <p>
    "A tag is more or less just a tiny wrapper that tells us what kind of thing we are holding. The shape of the tag object is: "
  </>

  <pre>
    <code { 'bablr-lang': 'https://bablr.org/languages/universe/es6', 'bablr-prod': 'Statement' }>
      "let tag = { type, value };" "\n"
    </>
  </>

  <p>
    <code "tag.type" { 'bablr-lang': 'https://bablr.org/languages/universe/es6' } /> " is a registered Symbol (it uses " <code "Symbol.for(typeName)" { 'bablr-lang': 'https://bablr.org/languages/universe/es6' } />  "), and it tells us what kind of thing a tag represents, and thus what shape of data should expect to find in " <code "value" /> "."
  </>

  <p>
    "Here are the basic types of tags which may occur in an agAST document:"
  </>

  <pre>
    <code { 'bablr-lang': 'https://bablr.org/languages/universe/es6', 'bablr-prod': 'Statement' }>
      "let tagStream = [" "\n"
      "  // <!0:cstml { bablr: { language: 'https://path/to/language' } }>" "\n"
      "  {" "\n"
      "    type: DoctypeTag," "\n"
      "    value: {" "\n"
      "      version: 0," "\n"
      "      attributes: { bablr: { language: 'https://path/to/language' } }," "\n"
      "    }" "\n"
      "  }," "\n"
      "  // <_>" "\n"
      "  {" "\n"
      "    type: OpenNodeTag," "\n"
      "    value: {" "\n"
      "      type: '_'," "\n"
      "      name: null," "\n"
      "      attributes: {}," "\n"
      "      literalValue: null," "\n"
      "      selfClosing: false" "\n"
      "    }" "\n"
      "  }," "\n"
      "  // _+:" "\n"
      "  {" "\n"
      "    type: ReferenceTag," "\n"
      "    value: {" "\n"
      "      type: '_'," "\n"
      "      name: null," "\n"
      "      isArray: false," "\n"
      "      flags: { expression: true, intrinsic: false, hasGap: false }," "\n"
      "    }" "\n"
      "  }," "\n"
      "  // <Node>" "\n"
      "  {" "\n"
      "    type: OpenNodeTag," "\n"
      "    value: {" "\n"
      "      type: null," "\n"
      "      name: 'Node'," "\n"
      "      attributes: {}," "\n"
      "      literalValue: null," "\n"
      "      selfClosing: false" "\n"
      "    }" "\n"
      "  }," "\n"
      "  // </>" "\n"
      "  {" "\n"
      "    type: CloseNodeTag," "\n"
      "    value: undefined" "\n"
      "  }," "\n"
      "  // ^^^" "\n"
      "  {" "\n"
      "    type: ShiftTag," "\n"
      "    value: undefined" "\n"
      "  }," "\n"
      "  // <Node>" "\n"
      "  {" "\n"
      "    type: OpenNodeTag," "\n"
      "    value: {" "\n"
      "      type: null," "\n"
      "      name: 'OuterNode'," "\n"
      "      attributes: {}," "\n"
      "      literalValue: null," "\n"
      "      selfClosing: false" "\n"
      "    }" "\n"
      "  }," "\n"
      "  // :Language:" "\n"
      "  {" "\n"
      "    type: BindingTag," "\n"
      "    value: {" "\n"
      "      segments: [{" "\n"
      "        type: null," "\n"
      "        name: 'Language'" "\n"
      "      }]" "\n"
      "    }" "\n"
      "  }," "\n"
      "  // inner:" "\n"
      "  {" "\n"
      "    type: ReferenceTag," "\n"
      "    value: {" "\n"
      "      type: null," "\n"
      "      name: 'inner'," "\n"
      "      isArray: false," "\n"
      "      flags: { expression: false, intrinsic: false, hasGap: false,  }," "\n"
      "    }" "\n"
      "  }," "\n"
      "  // <//>" "\n"
      "  {" "\n"
      "    type: GapTag," "\n"
      "    value: undefined" "\n"
      "  }," "\n"
      "  // </>" "\n"
      "  {" "\n"
      "    type: CloseNodeTag," "\n"
      "    value: undefined" "\n"
      "  }," "\n"
      "  // empty:" "\n"
      "  {" "\n"
      "    type: ReferenceTag," "\n"
      "    value: {" "\n"
      "      type: null," "\n"
      "      name: 'empty'," "\n"
      "      isArray: false," "\n"
      "      flags: { expression: false, intrinsic: false, hasGap: false,  }," "\n"
      "    }" "\n"
      "  }," "\n"
      "  // null" "\n"
      "  {" "\n"
      "    type: NullTag," "\n"
      "    value: undefined" "\n"
      "  }," "\n"
      "  // </>" "\n"
      "  {" "\n"
      "    type: CloseNodeTag," "\n"
      "    value: undefined" "\n"
      "  }," "\n"
      "];" "\n"
    </>
  </>
</>
